  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/788003676354255570-leap.gif\" alt=\"undefined\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wbuZQXJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&label=discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 服务器\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.moddinglegacy.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/translate-weblate-2ECCAA?style=for-the-badge&logo=weblate&logoColor=white\" alt=\"通过 Weblate 翻译来帮助打破语言障碍，为 Leap 做出贡献！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"如果您喜欢我们的工作，请考虑在 Ko-fi 上支持我们！谢谢！\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&logo=neoforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"基于 NeoForge 构建\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"关注我们！ModdingLegacy Twitter\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fmoddinglegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/moddinglegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&logoColor=00&style=social\" alt=\"关注我们！moddinglegacy.com Bluesky\"> </a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&style=social&label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上订阅我们！\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-style:italic;text-align:center;font-weight:600\">使用这款简单的模组向前迈进一步，它添加了一个允许你二段跳的新附魔！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">💡 Leap 是什么？</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">“腾跃”附魔的获取方式与其他宝藏附魔相同，可以作为宝箱战利品、钓鱼获得，或从图书管理员村民处交易得到。该附魔仅有一级。此附魔仅限靴子使用。当你的角色处于下落状态时，随时可以使用二段跳。</p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">👪 相关模组</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">本模组属于一系列移动类附魔模组的一部分。Step 模组无需安装这些模组即可正常运行，但它们是由同一团队共同开发的。不过，Leap 可能无法与 Step 同时附魔在同一双靴子上。与其他两个模组不同，Frost Walker（冰霜行者）和 Depth Strider（深海探索者）可以与 Step 兼容。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dash\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dash</a> - 一款冲刺模组，为靴子添加新附魔让你能够快速冲刺。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/step\" rel=\"nofollow\">Step</a> - 通过本模组提升原版体验，它添加了平衡的“踏步”附魔，让你能像马一样走上完整的方块。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">🤷 常见问题解答 (FAQ)</h3>\n<h3 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">我可以在整合包中使用它吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">当然可以。只需注明所有作者的贡献，并链接回 CurseForge 页面即可。</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">我可以将此模组重新分发到其他平台吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">可以，但在此之前请确保所有下载链接都直接指向 CurseForge，并注明所有作者的贡献。</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">腾跃附魔有多个等级吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">目前只有一个等级，但未来可能会增加。我们希望能专注于平衡性，避免制作过于强大的功能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#8f5660;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em\">🌐 翻译 Leap - 帮助打破语言障碍！</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">所有译者均在此致谢。感谢每一位帮助使本模组更易于访问的人！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"Flag for Català (Catalunya)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>加泰罗尼亚语（加泰罗尼亚）翻译：Minaderm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/czechrepublic.png\" alt=\"Flag for Čeština (Česko)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>捷克语（捷克）翻译：bart.vorel2017</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/germany.png\" alt=\"Flag for Deutsch\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>德语翻译：A1403</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"Flag for Español (España)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>西班牙语（西班牙）翻译：Minaderm</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/france.png\" alt=\"Flag for Français (France)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>法语（法国）翻译：aethyus</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/hungary.png\" alt=\"Flag for Magyar (Magyarország)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>匈牙利语（匈牙利）翻译：orsosemil092</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/japan.png\" alt=\"Flag for 日本語 (Nihongo)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>日语翻译：Isana</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/southkorea.png\" alt=\"Flag for 한국어 (Hangugeo)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>韩语翻译：othuntgithub</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/lithuania.png\" alt=\"Flag for Lietuvių\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>立陶宛语翻译：WaryRGMCA</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/belgium.png\" alt=\"Flag for Vlaams (Vlaanderen)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>弗拉芒语（佛兰德斯）翻译：zjefken.decooman</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/poland.png\" alt=\"Flag for Polski (Polska)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>波兰语（波兰）翻译：filipwyjcii</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/russia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Русский (Russkiy)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>俄语翻译：DrHesperus, 666nikgamer</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/slovakia.png\" alt=\"Flag for Slovenčina (Slovensko)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>斯洛伐克语（斯洛伐克）翻译：keksik.youtub</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/china.png\" alt=\"Flag for 简体中文（中国大陆）\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>简体中文（中国大陆）翻译：Aikini</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/taiwan.png\" alt=\"Flag for 繁體中文（台灣）\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>繁体中文（台湾）翻译：Aikini</strong> </span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"color:#f00;font-size:2.5em\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-size:1.1em;line-height:1em\"><strong>🤚 支持：如果您对我们的模组有任何疑问或问题，请阅读常见问题解答！您也可以<a style=\"display:inline;color:#f00;font-size:1.3em;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fgroups%252fmodding-legacy%252f-%252fissues\" rel=\"nofollow\">在问题追踪器上提交反馈</a>，或加入我们的 Discord 服务器，我们将为您提供帮助！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wbuZQXJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord 服务器\"></a></p>",
